Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.23,0:00:17.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(240,230)\bord0\fs18\b1}柬埔寨  金边
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.87,0:01:54.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.38,0:02:05.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.26,0:03:28.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那怎么回事\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}The hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.50,0:03:29.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.88,0:03:33.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我们得找人救治他  -不  你们得跑\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- We have to get him help. - No. You need to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.09,0:03:37.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫丹尼  我在追踪手和会的人\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}My name is Danny. I'm hunting members of the Hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.64,0:03:40.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得你是我要找的人\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I think you're the man we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.76,0:03:42.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,铁拳\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Iron Fist.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.04,0:03:44.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回家吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.06,0:03:50.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道我是谁\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.27,0:03:56.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要打的仗  不在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}The war you're fighting... it's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.24,0:04:01.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在纽约市\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It's in New York City.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.13,0:04:04.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}No... No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.21,0:05:31.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord0\fs18\b1}捍卫者联盟\N第一季 第一集
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.54,0:05:35.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关门了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Closing time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.44,0:05:38.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回家吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.34,0:05:42.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托  夜晚才刚刚开始\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Come on, the night's just getting started.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.71,0:05:43.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夜晚\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Night?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.84,0:05:49.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.49,0:05:53.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.25,0:05:56.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等  等等  先生\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Excuse me! Excuse me, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.30,0:05:57.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  真对不起\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}No, um, I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.55,0:05:59.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-这是我的车  -现在不是了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- This is my car. - Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.29,0:06:01.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到早9点  它就属于城市了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}At nine a.m., it became city property.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.07,0:06:01.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只能在卸货区停车\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Loading zone only.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.90,0:06:03.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-拜托  我可以开走的  -钩上了就没机会了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Please. I can move it. - Not once it's hitched.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.85,0:06:06.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你可以去49街的扣车场赎回\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}But you can come to the impound on 49th to reclaim it
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.41,0:06:07.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚六点之前都行\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}any time before six p.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.50,0:06:11.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,劳埃德  你干什么呢\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Lloyd, what the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.93,0:06:16.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.33,0:06:19.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有问题吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}We got a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.04,0:06:21.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我昨天接到电话\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I got a call yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.38,0:06:23.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又有一个制作人想拍你的故事\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}A second producer who wants to tell your story.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.62,0:06:24.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝不要\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Hard pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.51,0:06:26.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,纽约喜欢胜利者  不管你高不高兴\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}New York loves a winner, and like it or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.47,0:06:29.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你抵抗了一个很坏的人  还获得了胜利\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}you stood up to a really awful person and won.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.46,0:06:31.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道多少公关会为这样的关注收钱吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You know how much publicists charge for that kind of attention?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.57,0:06:32.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要多少钱能让它停下\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}How much to make it stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.67,0:06:34.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是说  你该考虑一下\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'm just saying, you might wanna consider it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.69,0:06:37.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能让你有钱付账单  直到你再找到工作\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It could help keep your bills paid until you start working again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.60,0:06:39.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我的账单不成问题  -现在还不是\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- My bills aren't a problem. - Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.43,0:06:41.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你至少开始接电话了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Have you at least started answering the phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.91,0:06:47.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有你能把那样大的个人胜利变成失败\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Only you could turn that big personal victory into a defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.40,0:06:50.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-你知道你的问题是什么吗  -这样开始的句子\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- You know what your problem is? - Sentences that start like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.26,0:06:52.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不喜欢你变成的东西\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You're not comfortable with what you've become.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.61,0:06:53.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杰西卡  你现在\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Jessica, you are now
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.86,0:06:56.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-是个货真价实的超级  -别说英开头的那个词\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- a full-blown super- - Do not say the H-word.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.32,0:06:59.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-杰西  -我已经够头疼了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Jess... - I-I've got enough of a headache as it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.44,0:07:01.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是说  你该考虑回趟家\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'm just saying, you might wanna consider going home,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.51,0:07:04.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,睡会儿觉  然后再回归社会\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}getting some sleep, rejoining society.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.13,0:07:05.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我这不跟你说话呢嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'm talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.60,0:07:07.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很感激\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}And I appreciate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.72,0:07:11.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-这里面是有威士忌吗  -是啊  那杯是我的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Is there whiskey in this? - Oh, yeah, that's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.97,0:07:44.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来你鼓捣文件没白忙活\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Looks like all of your paper-pushing worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.90,0:07:49.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给这位明星解开  把他带走\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Uncuff the superstar. Get him out of my sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.68,0:08:00.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不好\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}My bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.49,0:08:04.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是你的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}These belong to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.54,0:08:23.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卢卡斯先生  凯奇先生\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Mr. Lucas? Mr. Cage?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.22,0:08:26.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-你喜欢哪个来着  我忘了  -凯奇\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Which do you prefer? I forget. - Cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.54,0:08:30.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我认识你吗  -富兰克林·尼尔森\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Do I know you? - Franklin Nelson.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.37,0:08:35.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我负责你的案子  我们经常通电话\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I ran point on your case. We spoke on the phone... A lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.20,0:08:36.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你经常说话\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You spoke a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.99,0:08:38.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要好使就成\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}As long as it worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.99,0:08:41.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-多谢  -感谢你朋友波比·菲什吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- I appreciate it. - Appreciate your friend Bobby Fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.16,0:08:44.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都完成了不少工作\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}We all did some impressive book-cracking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.40,0:08:46.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且  你在监狱困难时期\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Plus, you made it through a prison stint
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.93,0:08:48.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有动过粗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}without throwing a single punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.38,0:08:49.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我相信这不容易  考虑到你的...\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'm sure that was hard for a person with your...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.94,0:08:52.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我知道  -名声\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- I know. - ...reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.30,0:08:55.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-克莱尔会来吗  -这里只有律师能进\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Is, uh... Claire coming? - It's lawyers only in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.79,0:08:59.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那失陪  我还得去赶大巴\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Well, if you'll excuse me, I have a bus to catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.53,0:09:02.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然  还有一件事\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Of course. Uh, just one last thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.38,0:09:06.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,霍加斯-赵-班诺维茨事务所随时为您服务\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}The law firm of Hogarth, Chao & Benowitz is at your disposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.86,0:09:08.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果您需要重新开始\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}In case you need help starting over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.30,0:09:11.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会重新开始  尼尔森先生\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'm not starting over, Mr. Nelson.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.10,0:09:13.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要向前看\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'm moving forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.14,0:09:15.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家喊我福吉\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}People call me Foggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.01,0:09:16.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就默许了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}And you let them?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.36,0:09:26.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您是公开声明  50街和10街交叉口的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You're on record as saying that the new subway station
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.41,0:09:29.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地铁站会是  "对社区有利的"\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}at 50th and 10th would be, quote, "Good for the community."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.06,0:09:33.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会是...引述  "对社区有利的"\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Would be quote-- quote, unquote, "Good for the community."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.51,0:09:36.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,博科威兹先生  以您专业...\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Mr. Berkowitz, in your professional-
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.55,0:09:40.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.59,0:09:42.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你干什么  看我爆了你的头\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}'Sup, man? I'll bust your goddamn head!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.48,0:09:44.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-是吗  来啊  -想干什么\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Oh, yeah? Let's go, then. - What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.69,0:09:47.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-想来挑衅一下吗  -来啊  上啊\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- You wanna try something? - Come at me. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.55,0:09:52.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,纽约警局  散开  够了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}NYPD! Break it up! That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.62,0:09:55.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-你  人行道上的  -是  长官\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- You, up on the sidewalk. - Yes, sir, officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.09,0:10:00.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,博科威兹先生\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Mr. Berkowitz...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.05,0:10:02.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以您专业的意见  这对亚伦·詹姆斯好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}In your professional opinion, was it good for Aaron James?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.74,0:10:04.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们同情他们一家\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Our sympathies go out to the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.20,0:10:05.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但这件事  是个不幸\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}The whole thing... It's very unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.80,0:10:07.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您可知道您新地铁站用的产品\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Were you aware the products used in your new station
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.68,0:10:08.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对儿童有害吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}were hazardous to children?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.66,0:10:10.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-反对  -我重说\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Objection! - I'll rephrase.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.02,0:10:11.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恩德萨本有什么优势\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}What was attractive about Endexoprene?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.73,0:10:13.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,强韧  持久\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It's strong. It's durable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.45,0:10:15.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-价钱是别的一半  -我毕竟是做生意的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- And half the price? - Well, I do run a business.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.20,0:10:18.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了省钱  就值得危害别人吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Is it worth endangering people in the interest of saving money?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.85,0:10:21.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有材料经过了测试\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}All materials are tested.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.36,0:10:22.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些发现一被公布\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}The moment those findings were made public,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.84,0:10:25.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们公司立刻换掉了其他所有站台的灰浆\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}our company replaced that mortar in all remaining stations.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.67,0:10:27.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"一被公布"\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}"Made public."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.04,0:10:31.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.58,0:10:35.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是指9月29日公布的一份报告吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Are you referring to a report released on September 29th?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.61,0:10:36.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,法官大人  他在要求我的委托人\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Your Honor, he's asking my client
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.87,0:10:39.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做出不合理的详尽回答\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}to respond with unreasonable specificity.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.03,0:10:40.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,博科威兹先生  如果我没记错\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Mr. Berkowitz, if memory serves me right,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.66,0:10:42.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您办公室于6月3日就收到了一份\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}your office received an urgent delivery
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.12,0:10:44.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来自安全委员会的急件\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}from the Safety Commission on June 3rd.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.20,0:10:45.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是三个月前\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Three months earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.16,0:10:47.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好奇  那是否跟恩德萨本有任何关系\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'm curious, did that have anything to do with Endexoprene?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.36,0:10:48.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我毫不知情\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I don't know anything about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.33,0:10:49.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,法官大人  默多克先生\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Your Honor, unless Mr. Murdock
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.61,0:10:50.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,若能证明我的委托人\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}can prove my client
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.62,0:10:53.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的收到了这些假设存在的文件  那\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}actually received these hypothetical documents, then--
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.05,0:10:54.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重点不是收没收到\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It's not about whether he received them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.09,0:10:55.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而是他是否有意无视了它\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It's whether he willfully ignored them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.88,0:10:57.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,法官大人  我要求将这份送达记录\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Your Honor, I ask that this record of delivery
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.33,0:10:58.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收录证据\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}be admitted into evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.57,0:11:01.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我经常收到这玩意  -哪样最糟\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- I mean, I get a lot of those. - What would you say is worse?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.61,0:11:03.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为节省成本而无视数据\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Ignoring data in the interest of cutting costs?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.61,0:11:05.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是没有向法庭提交\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Or neglecting to supply the court with records
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.24,0:11:07.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许能证明你有意危及他人生命的证据\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}that might prove you purposely put people in danger?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.32,0:11:08.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-包括这位年轻人  -法官大人\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Including this young man - Your Honor--
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.47,0:11:09.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,包括这位年轻人\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Including this young man,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.49,0:11:11.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚伦·詹姆斯  他可能再也无法走路\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Aaron James, who might never walk again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.37,0:11:13.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,法官大人  我们想请求休庭\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Your Honor, we would like a recess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.25,0:11:14.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不需要  我说完了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}No need. I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.35,0:11:16.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得他也完了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I think he is, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.78,0:11:28.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一千一百万\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}$11 million!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.29,0:11:30.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你  默多克先生\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Thank you, Mr. Murdock.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.65,0:11:32.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-不客气  -谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Oh, my pleasure. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.76,0:11:34.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很为你高兴\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'm so happy for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.37,0:11:39.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}God.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.70,0:11:46.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-你还好吧  -嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- You okay? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.19,0:11:54.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能跟你说句话吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Mind if I tell you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.59,0:11:56.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.56,0:12:01.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那钱对你父母会有很大帮助\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}That money is really gonna help your parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.87,0:12:04.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但对于你  从今往后\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}But for you, from here on out...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.26,0:12:06.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只会越来越难  亚伦\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}it's only gonna get harder, Aaron.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.02,0:12:10.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要知道你现在是在马拉松的第一英里\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You realize you're only at mile one of the marathon...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.80,0:12:12.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.99,0:12:15.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每个人都会告诉你该有怎样的感受\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Everybody's gonna tell you how to feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.98,0:12:18.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,医生会告诉你保持积极\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Doctors are gonna tell you to stay positive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.52,0:12:20.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的家人会告诉你不要自怨自艾\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Your family's gonna tell you not to feel sorry for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.41,0:12:22.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的治疗师会告诉你别生气\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Your therapist is gonna tell you not to be angry--
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.46,0:12:24.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经生气了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'm already angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.09,0:12:25.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,气谁\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}At who?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.04,0:12:29.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每一个人\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.08,0:12:33.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只想要回我的生活\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I just want my life back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.53,0:12:35.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是别人给不了的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}They can't give you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.78,0:12:39.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许你会再站起来\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Maybe you'll walk again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.02,0:12:41.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望能\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.71,0:12:44.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但或许你不会\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}But maybe you won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.13,0:12:50.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但随着生活越来越难  如果你还能撑下来\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}But your ability to get through it... as this gets harder...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.51,0:12:53.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那比强颜欢笑\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}that is a hundred times more powerful
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.06,0:12:54.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,假装一切都好\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}than slapping a smile on your face
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.71,0:12:56.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要强大千百倍\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}and pretending like everything's just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.08,0:13:00.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你明白吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.21,0:13:04.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Listen...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.81,0:13:07.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有人能把你的生活还给你  亚伦\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}no one can give you your life back, Aaron.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.24,0:13:11.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得...自己夺回来\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You have... You gotta take it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.16,0:13:19.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.96,0:13:40.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭喜  默多克先生\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Congratulations, Mr. Murdock.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.65,0:13:43.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢  佩吉小姐\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Thank you, Ms. Page.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.80,0:13:46.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的  你该为自己自豪\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It's okay. You can be proud of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.51,0:13:48.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稍稍骄傲一下吧  我不会说出去\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}A little. I won't tell anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.56,0:13:52.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你来采访的吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You, uh, here for a statement?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.88,0:13:53.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.52,0:13:59.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想不想  边吃边说\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You maybe wanna go... do that over a bite or...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.07,0:14:02.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Sure, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.21,0:14:05.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等我五分钟吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Can you give me five minutes?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.65,0:14:11.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-默多克先生  -默多克先生\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Mr. Murdock... - Mr. Murdock, sir...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.16,0:14:12.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.29,0:16:08.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你抛弃了他们\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You abandoned them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.85,0:16:13.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你  手和会赢了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Because of you, the Hand has won.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.15,0:16:15.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.31,0:16:16.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们养大了你\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}After they raised you...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.15,0:16:19.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成就了你的一切\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}after they gave you everything you are...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.06,0:16:22.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你却让他们死去了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}you let them die.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.03,0:16:22.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.15,0:16:25.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.34,0:16:29.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-丹尼  醒醒  -不\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Danny. Wake up. - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.33,0:16:30.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.30,0:16:32.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丹尼\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Danny.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.66,0:16:37.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.64,0:16:42.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.25,0:16:46.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是...紊流\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It's just the... It's just the turbulence.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.47,0:16:50.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得我永远适应不了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I don't think I'll ever get used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.71,0:17:01.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-丹尼  -我\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Danny... - I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.13,0:17:05.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去跟飞行员问问\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'm gonna go check with the pilot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.70,0:17:08.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丹尼\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Danny.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.33,0:17:12.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要不要告诉我你在想什么\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Are you gonna talk to me about whatever's on your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.32,0:17:16.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Look, it was...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.46,0:17:18.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.92,0:17:21.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你又尖叫起来了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You were screaming. Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.37,0:17:26.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.47,0:17:31.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得我们对"没事"的理解不太一样\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I think we have different understandings of the word "fine."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.37,0:17:41.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们追踪手和会几个月了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}We've been chasing the Hand for months.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.99,0:17:46.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们终于找到了一个据说能帮我们的人的线索\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}We finally get a lead on a guy who can supposedly help us...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.85,0:17:50.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们赶到时却只能看着他死去\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}and we get there just in time to watch him die.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.28,0:17:51.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不怪你\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It is not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.42,0:17:55.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我让那女人逃了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I let that woman escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.20,0:17:58.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没让谁怎么样\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You didn't let anyone do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.74,0:18:01.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管她是谁  我从没见过像她动作那么快的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Whoever she was, she moved faster than anyone I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.98,0:18:03.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.21,0:18:06.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她出手也快\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}She hit like it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.89,0:18:14.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定是手和会  是吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It had to be the Hand, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.91,0:18:16.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.49,0:18:21.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,手和会可隐瞒了我很多事\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}There are a lot of things that the Hand kept from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.46,0:18:26.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们不是那种会很容易解决的问题\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}They're not the kind of problem that's gonna go away easily,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.62,0:18:28.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我们可以解决的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}but we can figure this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.57,0:18:30.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一起解决\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Together.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.41,0:18:39.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们想在纽约干什么\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}What do they want in New York?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.60,0:19:07.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得脱衣服  首饰什么的都摘掉\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You'll need to disrobe. Jewelry and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.93,0:19:42.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉让你久等\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Sorry to keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.61,0:19:46.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么上一轮测试的结果\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}The results of the last round of tests
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.07,0:19:47.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你已经知道了吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}were explained to you, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.80,0:19:51.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怕结果是决定性的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}They're rather conclusive, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.13,0:19:56.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是说...\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}And by that, of course, what I mean to say is--
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.04,0:19:57.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要死了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'm dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.03,0:20:01.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的血红细胞数量锐减\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}My red blood cell count has dropped precipitously
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.72,0:20:06.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我所有的主要器官也都几乎要崩溃\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}and almost every one of my major organs is close to collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.26,0:20:08.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在还是这样吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Is that still the case?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.64,0:20:13.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要如何治疗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}What can you do to treat it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.29,0:20:15.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老实说  这样的衰竭简直超乎想象\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}To be honest, this kind of free fall is off the charts.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.77,0:20:17.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这话没用\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}That's not helpful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.64,0:20:19.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且答非所问\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Or even what I asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.89,0:20:23.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很不幸  就算是对您这样神通广大的人\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Well, unfortunately, even for someone with your resources...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.63,0:20:26.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也帮不了什么\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}there's not much we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.33,0:20:36.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还剩多久\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}How much time do I have left?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.08,0:20:40.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能几个月  可能几周\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Could be months. Could be weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.83,0:20:44.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得这会让我们得到更确定的答案\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I think this should give us more definitive answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.96,0:20:45.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.96,0:21:05.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们开始吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Let's begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.27,0:21:24.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天呐  该死\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Jesus. Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.16,0:21:26.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,琼斯小姐\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Ms. Jones?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.96,0:21:29.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫米歇尔·雷蒙德\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}My name is Michelle Raymond.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.49,0:21:31.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我女儿  莱克西  我们需要你帮忙\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}This is my daughter, Lexi. We need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.03,0:21:33.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我帮不了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.12,0:21:36.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起  我们都不确定是不是来对了地方\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'm sorry. We weren't sure if we were in the right place.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.29,0:21:38.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天不行  可能明天也不行\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Not today. Probably not tomorrow, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.77,0:21:40.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-走吧  妈妈  -我读到了你的作为\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Come on, Mom. - I read about what you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.76,0:21:41.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她才不在乎\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}She doesn't give a shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.90,0:21:45.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我丈夫失踪了  -她就是个行走的笑话\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- My husband is missing. - She's a walking shit show anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.05,0:21:47.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-什么  -莱克西  够了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Excuse me? - Lexi, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.74,0:21:52.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们情况不好  他已经失踪一整周了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}We are not doing great. He has been gone a full week.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.31,0:21:53.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-你报警了吗  -没有\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Did you call the cops? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.65,0:21:56.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-为什么不呢  他们免费  -钱不是问题\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Why not? They're free. - Money is not an issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.67,0:22:00.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不对劲  我确定  约翰像表一样准时\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Something is wrong and I know it. John's like clockwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.80,0:22:03.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是个建筑师  他每天早上都8点去上班\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}He's an architect. He goes to work every morning at eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.90,0:22:05.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚上6点30分回家\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}He comes back home every night at 6:30.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.73,0:22:06.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但最近  他...\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}But lately, he's-
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.36,0:22:08.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他变了个人  神神秘秘的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}He's been different? Secretive?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.24,0:22:10.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-或许还有点紧张  -这不像他\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Maybe even a little nervous? - And it's not like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.85,0:22:13.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是因为他出轨了  好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Because he's cheating on you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.42,0:22:16.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么可耻的  这种事常有\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Nothing to be ashamed about. It happens all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.11,0:22:18.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-你不像我那么了解他  -没必要\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- You don't know him like I do. - I don't need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.14,0:22:21.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你来找我  我给出了专业意见\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}But you came to me and I'm giving you my professional opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.23,0:22:22.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你需要的是离婚律师\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You need a divorce lawyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.96,0:22:26.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多谢您抽时间  琼斯小姐\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Thank you for your time, Ms. Jones.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.09,0:22:29.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  多谢了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Yeah, thanks so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.07,0:22:40.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管他在做什么  希望你能找到他\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Whatever he's doing... I hope you find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.88,0:23:00.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打错了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Wrong number.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.21,0:23:02.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杰西卡·琼斯\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Jessica Jones,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.57,0:23:05.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮自己个忙  别去找约翰·雷蒙德\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}do yourself a favor and don't look for John Raymond.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.30,0:23:07.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.04,0:24:11.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,陌生人  你好啊\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Stranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.03,0:24:15.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要去喝那杯咖啡吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Should we get that coffee?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.39,0:24:37.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等你是一场豪赌\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Waiting on you was a heck of a gamble.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.94,0:24:41.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毕竟  说不定你本事不行呢\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}For all I knew, you could've sucked at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.03,0:24:42.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.63,0:24:45.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望我值得你等\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Well, I hope I was worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.65,0:24:46.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你挺有潜质\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You got potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.24,0:24:49.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,潜质啊\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}"Potential"? Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.30,0:24:57.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里面有些日子真的很不好过\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}There were some really rough days inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.05,0:25:01.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你的信  帮我撑了过来\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}But your letters... they got me through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.14,0:25:05.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都不记得上次手写信是什么时候了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I can't remember the last time I handwrote a letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.33,0:25:10.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-还有那次的那首诗呢  -天呐\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- There was that poem that one time. - Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.05,0:25:13.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-不  挺好的  -谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- No, it was a good one. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.58,0:25:15.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an3\fs16\bord0\fn微软雅黑\b0\pos(374,247)}美国非裔诗人
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.58,0:25:15.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然是妮基·乔瓦尼的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I mean, it was also Nikki Giovanni.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.88,0:25:20.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-嗯  -我们不能都像你那么俗嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Yeah. - We all can't be your corny ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.27,0:25:22.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我宁可俗也不抄袭\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'd rather be corny than to plagiarize.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.28,0:25:25.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还注意到你的信有一点\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}There was something else I noticed about your letters...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.51,0:25:27.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没说的事\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}What you didn't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.25,0:25:30.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-卢克  -我懂的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Luke - Look, I know the drill.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.83,0:25:33.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,男人进去了  你觉得有事不能跟他说\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Man goes inside, you think there are things you can't tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.56,0:25:38.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但不管哈莱姆发生了什么  我都会查明白\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}But whatever's going on in Harlem... I'm gonna find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.42,0:25:42.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不能再享受会儿这个吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Look, can't we just enjoy this part a little longer?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.77,0:25:47.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要知道\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.83,0:25:50.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈莱姆发生了一些变化\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Harlem's gone through changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.38,0:25:53.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是必然的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It was bound to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.18,0:25:55.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛莉娅在做什么\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}What's Mariah doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.44,0:25:58.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你走时她在做的那些破事\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}The same shit she was doing when you left.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.70,0:26:03.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在  你唯一需要考虑的  就是你自己\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Look, right now, the only thing you need to worry about is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.63,0:26:05.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你是想要我去找份工作\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Look, if you're talking about getting a job,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.47,0:26:07.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我完全有做那个的意思\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I have every intention of doing just that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.84,0:26:08.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做什么\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Doing what?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.70,0:26:13.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做哈莱姆的英雄  你还怎么能好好生活\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}How does being Harlem's hero allow you to live an actual life?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.24,0:26:15.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会有办法的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'll find a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.01,0:26:18.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Right now, just...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.04,0:26:20.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想帮助大家\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I just wanna help people.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.01,0:26:22.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也想\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I wanna do that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.49,0:26:27.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是算我自私  我希望你照顾好自己\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}But call me selfish... I wanna see you take care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.32,0:26:39.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁啊\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.68,0:26:51.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-真帅  -谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Good look. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.49,0:26:55.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉打扰  \N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Sorry to interrupt.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.41,0:26:58.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但很高兴你安顿下来了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}But I'm glad to see you're settling in.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.23,0:27:02.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,米丝蒂  见到你很高兴\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Misty. It's good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.68,0:27:04.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,见到你也很高兴  卢克\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Good to see you, too, Luke.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.45,0:27:06.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么知道去哪找我\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}How did you know where to find me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.84,0:27:09.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开玩笑吗  你是哈莱姆的英雄\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Are you kidding? You're the hero of Harlem.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.54,0:27:11.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要一起去走走吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Wanna come for a walk?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.75,0:27:15.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-其实  -不会太久  我保证\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Actually, I was, uh - It won't take long, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.33,0:27:32.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,2号上菜\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Number two in the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.56,0:27:35.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上周的报道很不错\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Great story last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.30,0:27:38.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,校董会丑闻的那个\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}The, uh... thing with the school board scandal.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.48,0:27:41.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢  是啊  埃里森基本让我自主\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Thank you. Yeah, Ellison's pretty much given me free reign.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.96,0:27:45.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉这是我注定该做的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It feels like what I'm meant to be doing or...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.44,0:27:47.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道你能不能明白\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I don't know if that makes any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.19,0:27:50.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Yeah. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.88,0:27:53.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来你也在做你一直想做的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It looks like you're doing what you always wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.12,0:27:57.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  跟尼尔森-默多克的日子相去甚远了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Yeah, it's been a transition from the Nelson and Murdock days,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.95,0:28:00.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当时是合作\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}from the partnership but, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.88,0:28:03.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无偿案让我很开心\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}No, the pro bono work does make me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.33,0:28:05.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-那很好  真的...  -要点咖啡吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- That's great. That's really - Coffee?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.65,0:28:07.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-是的  谢谢  -谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Yes, thank you. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.73,0:28:16.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糖在左边  奶在右边\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Sugar's on the left. Cream's here on the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.20,0:28:18.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-奶在右边  谢谢  -不客气\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Cream on the right. Thank you. - Yes. You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.66,0:28:23.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-抱歉  -嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Sorry, it got... - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.77,0:28:26.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你希望你没把秘密说出来吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Do you wish you'd kept your secret to yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.82,0:28:28.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.13,0:28:31.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要你知道\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I needed you to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.93,0:28:33.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道我觉得会怎样\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I don't know what I expected,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.83,0:28:36.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我知道我不能再隐瞒你了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}but I... I know I couldn't lie to you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.73,0:28:40.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢  谢谢你这么说\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Thanks. I appreciate that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.99,0:28:43.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怀念吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Do you miss it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.24,0:28:46.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,紧身衣  面具\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}The suit? The mask?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.67,0:28:48.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.14,0:28:52.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉像我人生结束的一章\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It feels like a chapter of my life that's closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.29,0:28:55.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不后悔  只是...\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Now, I don't regret it. You know, I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.08,0:28:57.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我后悔我逼走了一些人  -不\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- I regret that it drove some people away. - No, it...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.91,0:29:00.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那没有逼走我\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Look, it didn't drive me away. I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.56,0:29:02.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是觉得我们\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You know, I felt like we should
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.89,0:29:05.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该先整理清楚自己\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}figure ourselves out first or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.32,0:29:08.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在努力\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'm trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.06,0:29:16.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然这些\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You know, as complicated
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.65,0:29:18.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我觉得很复杂\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}as I feel about all this stuff, I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.33,0:29:21.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得你该知道\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I feel like you should know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.48,0:29:25.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,纽约警局在胜利\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}The NYPD is prevailing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.05,0:29:28.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我每天都做报道  犯罪率在下降\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I report on it every day, and crime rate's down.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.54,0:29:29.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真的觉得\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I really think
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.35,0:29:32.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夜魔侠让城市更加安全了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}that Daredevil may have made the city a safer place.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.14,0:29:36.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}He might have.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.52,0:29:39.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但现在  城里没有他更好\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}But right now, the city's better off without him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.02,0:29:44.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有马特·默多克在更好\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Well, it's better off with Matt Murdock.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.31,0:29:50.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说到这个  默多克先生\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Speaking of which, Mr. Murdock...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.88,0:29:53.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想就今天\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I would like to take your statement
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.04,0:29:55.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神奇的亚伦·詹姆斯判决采访你\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}on today's miraculous Aaron James verdict.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.75,0:29:56.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.57,0:30:09.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-不  -怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- No. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.64,0:30:11.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不能又来那套\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}We are not doing that thing
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.11,0:30:12.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你大摇大摆地走进来像是住在这里似的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}where you come in here like you live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.75,0:30:15.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-是你给了我钥匙  -是你不经我允许\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- You gave me a key. - You took the spare key
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.02,0:30:17.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就换了锁时拿了一副备用钥匙\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}when you changed the locks without my permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.26,0:30:19.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,门坏了  我是帮了你个忙\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Door was broken, and I was doing you a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.63,0:30:21.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-有什么事  马尔科姆  -就拿点汽水\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- What do you want, Malcolm? - Just came for soda.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.41,0:30:24.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我们干什么呢  -我们不做什么\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- So what are we doing? - We are doing nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.70,0:30:26.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你接了案子  我看得出\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You took a case. I can tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.78,0:30:29.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-你又散发光彩了  -我没接案子\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- You've got that glow about you. - I did not take a case...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.76,0:30:31.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-还没接呢  -那是谁\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- yet. - Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.33,0:30:33.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-别从我后面看  -好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Don't read over my shoulder. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.95,0:30:35.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是个建筑师啊\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It's an architect, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.95,0:30:37.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-又是出轨的  -可能吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Another cheater? - Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.89,0:30:40.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他妻子跑来  急着找他\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}His wife showed up desperate to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.40,0:30:41.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她说了一堆我听过的说辞\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}She said a bunch of stuff I've heard before.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.99,0:30:44.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"他可干净了  这不像他"\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You know, "He's squeaky clean. This is unlike him."
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.13,0:30:46.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但然后我接到通电话\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}But then I got a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.87,0:30:49.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人用变声器叫我别接案子\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Someone used a voice scrambler and told me not to take the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.08,0:30:51.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你肯定可喜欢那个了  是吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Bet you loved that, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.55,0:30:53.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麻省理工学院毕业\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Graduated MIT.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.91,0:30:57.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在迪拜设计了两座摩天大楼  在曼哈顿设计了四座\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Designed two skyscrapers in Dubai and four in Manhattan.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.27,0:30:59.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的确干干净净  你觉得她说对了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}He is squeaky clean. You think she's right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.57,0:31:01.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许吧  或许他好人当烦了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Maybe. Maybe he's tired of being the good guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.18,0:31:04.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许他去饮酒作乐了  或许他在跟哪个实习生鬼混\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Maybe he's on a bender. Maybe he's knee-deep in some intern.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.88,0:31:06.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-恶心  -相当的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Gross. - Very.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.42,0:31:08.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你的线索有什么\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}So, what are your leads?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.56,0:31:10.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没在找线索  马尔科姆\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'm not looking for leads, Malcolm,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.50,0:31:11.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我还没接案子\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}because I haven't take the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.70,0:31:13.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得了  你追踪过电话吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Yeah, right. Have you tried tracking the call yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.99,0:31:16.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是那样的  电话可以改线路\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It doesn't work that way. You can reroute phone numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.51,0:31:18.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许他没有\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I mean, maybe he didn't, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.11,0:31:21.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许就是个普通人  想迷惑你\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Maybe he's just a regular guy trying to throw you off the scent.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.94,0:31:23.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-或许  -或许他是个外行\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Maybe - Maybe he's an amateur.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.98,0:31:33.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我刚接到一个屏蔽号码的来电\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I just got a call from a blocked number.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.45,0:31:35.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知你能不能告诉我是哪里打来的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I was wondering if you can tell me where it was coming from.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.77,0:31:39.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能想想办法吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Is there anything that you can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.78,0:31:42.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得可能是我爷爷  他老年痴呆\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You know, I think it's my grandfather and he's senile
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.67,0:31:44.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他可能是想联络我\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}and he might be trying to get a hold of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.68,0:31:46.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实  我这里有份失踪人口报告\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Actually, I have a missing person's report.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.51,0:31:47.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,号码就在我面前\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I have the number right in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.61,0:31:48.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以读给你听\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I can read it to you if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.87,0:31:52.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的  太感谢了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Really? Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.24,0:31:56.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这年头谁还用付费电话\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Who the hell uses pay phones anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.29,0:32:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-在哪  -11街和49街\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Where? - 11th and 49th.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.88,0:32:06.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道这地方\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I know this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.15,0:32:09.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果那人在那个街区干什么见不得人的事\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}If your guy's doing shady shit on that block,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.40,0:32:10.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他肯定在这儿\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}that's where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.67,0:32:11.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以前吸海洛因\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I used to do heroin.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.90,0:32:12.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道的不多\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I don't know much,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.53,0:32:14.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我知道人都去哪消失\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}but I know where people go to get off the grid.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.23,0:32:23.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-那么你要接了吗  -把钥匙还给我\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Does this mean you're taking the case? - I want my key back.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.87,0:32:25.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滚出我的公寓\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}And get out of my apartment!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.18,0:32:27.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还在当差吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Still in the force?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.30,0:32:29.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然你扳倒了响尾蛇\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Just 'cause you took down Diamondback,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.78,0:32:31.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,犯罪还是存在的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}doesn't mean crime went away.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.60,0:32:33.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我们扳倒了响尾蛇\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}We took down Diamondback.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.10,0:32:36.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在  我要扳倒玛莉娅和沙兹\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}And now I'm ready to take down Mariah and Shades.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.23,0:32:39.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有那么简单就好了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I wish it was that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.68,0:32:42.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道他们在干什么坏事\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I know their hands are in something.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.59,0:32:45.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许你需要一个法外援助\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Maybe you need another assist from outside the law.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.15,0:32:48.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-一个刚出狱的人吗  -那都过去了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- From somebody fresh out of lockup? - That's behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.11,0:32:52.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经洗清了过去  没什么可隐瞒了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Now that I've cleared up my past, I've got nothing to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.51,0:32:54.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的团队在查\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Look, my team is on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.20,0:32:57.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但哈莱姆需要你的帮助\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}But Harlem could use your help...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.32,0:33:00.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要你跟那位往树上绑黄丝带的小护士\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}once you're done spending nights with the nurse
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.01,0:33:02.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,缠绵够了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}who tied the ribbon round the oak tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.28,0:33:04.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说你的团队\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Your team, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.90,0:33:08.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你走后  我被调入一个全市范围的特遣队\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}When you left, I got put on a city-wide task force.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.73,0:33:09.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,貌似是晋升了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Sounds like a promotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.94,0:33:14.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只能说  我的片区不止哈莱姆了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}All I can say is my beat isn't just Harlem anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.21,0:33:17.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别误会  这里仍是我的家\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Now, make no mistake, this is still home.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.43,0:33:21.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-好的坏的都是  -这里发生了什么\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- The good and the bad. - What happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.34,0:33:23.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,官方说法  25岁男性\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Officially, 25-year-old male
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.15,0:33:25.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被发现死在一辆停着的车里\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}found deceased in a parked car.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.68,0:33:27.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非官方说法呢\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}And unofficially?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.80,0:33:30.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得有人在利用哈莱姆的年轻人\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I think somebody's been using Harlem's youth
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.55,0:33:33.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来进行  只能说是  深夜差事\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}for what can only be described as late-night duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.15,0:33:36.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-送货员  -可能吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Couriers? - Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.69,0:33:38.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甚至可能跟玛莉娅有关\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Might even be related to Mariah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.54,0:33:40.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得是别的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You think it's something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.92,0:33:45.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上月有七起  情况都一样\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Seven in the last few months. Always the same story.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.49,0:33:48.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈莱姆20几岁的孩子  让妈妈搬出了经济适用房\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Harlem 20-something moves his mom out of the projects
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.32,0:33:51.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搬进了新罗谢尔的豪宅\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}into a nice home in New Rochelle.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.73,0:33:53.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现金首付\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Down payment in cash.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.92,0:33:55.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么联系\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}What's the connection between them?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.52,0:33:57.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,查了名字  问了街邻\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Run their names, you talk to people...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.33,0:34:01.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用抢  不吸毒  就是份不入档的新工作\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}No guns, no drugs, just a new job, off the books.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.09,0:34:03.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干什么呢  没人知道\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Doing what? Nobody knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.39,0:34:08.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备听真正可悲的部分了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You ready for the real sad part?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.29,0:34:12.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记得坎迪斯吗  差一点就指证玛莉娅了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You remember Candace? This close to testifying against Mariah?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.97,0:34:15.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她的死还未侦破\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Murder still unsolved?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.07,0:34:18.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是他姐姐\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}That was his sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.87,0:34:23.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在只剩一个了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Now there's only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.59,0:34:25.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真该听到他们母亲那哭声\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You should've heard the way their mother cried.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.72,0:34:31.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能让我插手多深\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}How much can you let me in on this?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.59,0:34:33.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以查明幕后黑手\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'll find who's behind it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.51,0:34:35.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是可以\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You could do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.52,0:34:41.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也可以帮助指引这个年轻人走上另一条道路\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Or you could help guide this young man in a different direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.75,0:34:43.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像老爹以前那样\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}The way Pop used to.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.87,0:34:48.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听说清空了克里斯珀斯·阿塔克斯大楼的那小子吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You hear about that cat that cleaned up Crispus Attucks?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.99,0:34:49.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是他\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}That's him, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.71,0:34:54.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听说他被关在了佐治亚州什么地方\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Heard he was locked up somewhere down in Georgia.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.93,0:35:17.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保佑我  神父  我有罪\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Bless me, Father, for I have sinned.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.42,0:35:25.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我上次忏悔是三天前\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It's been... uh, three days since my last confession.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.97,0:35:32.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我骗了一个人  一个我爱的人\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I lied to someone. Someone I love.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.60,0:35:37.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她问我  是否怀念那种生活\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}She asked me if I, uh, miss the life.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.44,0:35:41.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的另一种生活\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}The other life that I led.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.11,0:35:46.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我告诉她不\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}And I told her I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.09,0:35:48.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,承认撒谎\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Acknowledging a lie
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.07,0:35:50.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,往往是找到真相的最佳路径  孩子\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}is often the best path to finding the truth, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.00,0:35:53.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样的谎言\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}A lie like this one...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.06,0:35:56.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,往往表明了犹豫不决\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}is often a sign of indecision.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.25,0:36:01.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,表明你的心智和灵魂尚未统一\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}A sign that your mind and your soul are not yet aligned.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.60,0:36:05.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在努力无视我的灵魂\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Well, I'm trying very hard to ignore my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.20,0:36:08.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"主所看到的与人不同\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}"The Lord sees not as man sees.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.98,0:36:11.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人看到的是外表\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Man looks on the outward appearance,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.42,0:36:13.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而主  看到的是心"\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}but the Lord... looks on the heart."
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.22,0:36:16.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以详说吗  神父\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}If you could elaborate, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.58,0:36:19.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无视不能改变什么  马修\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Ignoring doesn't change anything, Matthew.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.83,0:36:21.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上帝知道你的心\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}God knows your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.01,0:36:24.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让他进来  让他帮忙\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Let him in so he can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.90,0:36:28.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-哪怕那颗心已经受损  -尤其是这样的时候\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Even if that heart is damaged? - Especially if it's damaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.97,0:36:32.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马修  我想坦白地跟你说\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Matthew, I want to talk frankly.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.64,0:36:35.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-请吧  -你的另一个生活\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Please. - This other life you led...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.95,0:36:39.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的心还在那里\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}is your heart still with it...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.94,0:36:44.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是在那些陪伴你度过那种生活的人那里\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}or is your heart with the one who walked through it by your side?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.14,0:36:47.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾丽卡  是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Elektra. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.64,0:36:49.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是很想她\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I do miss her.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.37,0:36:55.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我知道  她从我这里激发出来的东西是错的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}But I know that the things she brought out of me were wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.95,0:36:57.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从你跟我讲的她来看\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}From what you've told me about her,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.39,0:37:00.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得她会对你过得这么好感到高兴的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I think she'd be happy about how well you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.37,0:37:01.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.38,0:37:05.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许她会说  我抛弃了那份生活\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Or maybe she'd tell me I'm abandoning that life.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.32,0:37:07.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也随之抛弃了她的回忆\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}And with it, her memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.25,0:37:09.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没有抛弃艾丽卡  你不是那种人\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You're not abandoning Elektra. You don't have it in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.87,0:37:14.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你所做的  叫向前看\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}What you're doing, we call that moving on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.41,0:37:18.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,炼狱是死者去的地方  马修  不是活人\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Purgatory is a place for the dead, Matthew, not the living.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.89,0:37:21.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对人释怀没什么不对\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}There's nothing wrong with letting people go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.33,0:37:23.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她会找到安宁\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}She'll find her peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.35,0:37:29.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我祈祷你也是\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I pray you find yours as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.58,0:37:52.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一向喜欢这里\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You always liked this spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.69,0:37:56.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是奇迹\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It's a miracle...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.26,0:38:00.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个公园居然还在\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}the fact that this park even exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.33,0:38:07.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,城市居然没有拆掉它  建高楼大厦\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}The fact that this city hasn't torn it down to put up high-rises.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.60,0:38:12.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些人肯定很难想象\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Must be hard for these people to imagine
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.95,0:38:17.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,整个曼哈顿岛曾是森林\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}the whole island of Manhattan as a forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.83,0:38:22.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,荷兰殖民者\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You know, the Dutch colonists...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.26,0:38:26.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当他们从土著那里买下曼哈顿岛时\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}when they bought Manhattan from the natives,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.94,0:38:31.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,据说整块地只花了  24美金\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}they're said to have acquired the whole thing for... $24.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.89,0:38:37.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要我说  太多了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Ask me, they overpaid.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.01,0:38:45.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,市长办公室的联络人  他准备好了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}The contact at the mayor's office... he's ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.27,0:38:48.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-什么时候能开始  -三个月\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- How soon can we begin? - Three months.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.39,0:38:51.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后进入最后阶段\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Then we move to the final phase.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.63,0:38:54.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不行  现在不行了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}That won't work. Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.62,0:38:57.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我们得更快点  -我们都说好了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- We need to move faster. - We all agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.74,0:39:00.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-这个计划可行  -原来可行\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- This plan, it makes sense. - Made sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.92,0:39:04.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安排是很费事的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It took great efforts to arrange this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.23,0:39:08.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我们加速进程  就会引人注意了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}If we speed the process, it will not be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.50,0:39:10.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'm aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.46,0:39:16.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去通知其他人\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I will inform the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.68,0:39:20.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好  顺便代我问好\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Good. Send my regards when you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.62,0:39:26.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮我把鸟喂完\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}And, uh... finish feeding the birds, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.53,0:39:31.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们今天饿了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}They're starving today.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.80,0:39:59.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们知道科尔在哪吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You guys know where I can find Cole?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.10,0:40:01.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关你什么事\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}What's it to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.77,0:40:08.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再上一层\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}One floor up.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.68,0:40:10.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.60,0:40:36.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫你们别再闹了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Man, I told y'all to stop playing!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.57,0:40:40.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是来表示悼念的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'm here to pay my respects.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.10,0:40:43.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯奇\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.99,0:40:46.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你是谁\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.31,0:40:53.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-你认识肖恩吗  -不\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Did you know Sean? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.18,0:40:56.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我认识你姐姐坎迪斯\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}But I knew your sister Candace.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.95,0:41:00.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我猜我也是来悼念她的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I guess I'm here to pay my respects for her, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.16,0:41:01.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这家人运气真好  是吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}This family's got some luck, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.81,0:41:07.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这里  坏事往往会发生在好人身上\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Around here, bad things have a tendency to happen to good people.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.26,0:41:10.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得你哥哥的死\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Do you think your brother's death
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.16,0:41:11.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会跟她的死有关吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}could somehow be related to hers?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.57,0:41:13.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我觉得不...\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}No. I don't think...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.76,0:41:19.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  肖恩的事  更多是起意外\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}No, what happened to Sean was, um... was more like an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.37,0:41:22.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-你确定吗  -是的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- You sure about that? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.39,0:41:26.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听说他找到份新工作\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I heard he got a new job.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.27,0:41:28.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我可不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I ain't know nothing about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.67,0:41:34.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不是无所不谈的  那是他的事\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I mean, we didn't talk about everything. That was his business.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.69,0:41:35.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.52,0:41:38.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你呢\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.35,0:41:40.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.56,0:41:43.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你情况似乎还不错\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Things seem to be going okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.24,0:41:47.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也找到了新工作吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Did you get a new gig?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.41,0:41:52.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我现在还在找工作\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}No. I'm just in between stuff right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.57,0:41:55.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我总在忙那个  懂吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'm always on that hustle, though. You feel me?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.86,0:41:56.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,懂\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.47,0:42:02.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  我能帮你\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Listen... I can help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.27,0:42:05.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,假设地说  如果你需要什么\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Hypothetically speaking, if you ever need anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.29,0:42:07.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得你该走了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I think you should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.20,0:42:11.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去问这里的任何人  我做了什么\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Ask anybody on this block what I've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.74,0:42:14.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或是我愿意做什么\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Or what I'm willing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.70,0:42:16.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以信任我\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You could trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.61,0:42:17.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经太迟了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It's too late for all of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.91,0:42:18.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么意思  太迟了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}What do you mean, "It's too late"?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.66,0:42:20.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-没事  -孩子  永远不太晚\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Nothing. - Son, it's never too late- -
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.41,0:42:21.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不是你的孩子\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Yo, man, I ain't your son!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.91,0:42:25.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说了  我什么都不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I told you, I don't know a damn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.74,0:42:31.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管你在做什么  你会让自己受伤的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Whatever you're doing, you're gonna get yourself hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.54,0:42:34.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想想你妈妈\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Think about your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.88,0:42:38.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想想她已经遭遇的一切\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}What she's already been through.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.37,0:42:49.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得你该走了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I think you should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.78,0:42:55.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唯一能帮我的办法就是把我也变得刀枪不入\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}The only way to help me is to make me bulletproof, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.83,0:43:00.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄已经来迟了\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It's too late for heroes.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.16,0:43:04.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄是你说的  不是我\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Hero's your word. Not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.46,0:43:20.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-我要我的钱  -我知道  会给你的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- I want my money. - I hear you. I'm gonna get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.79,0:43:22.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给你到今天晚上\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You got till the end of the day,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.78,0:43:24.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,否则我会回来  砸点东西\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}or I'm coming back here to bust some shit up!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.12,0:43:49.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约翰·雷蒙德  我是杰西卡·琼斯\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}John Raymond, it's Jessica Jones.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.37,0:43:53.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在回你的电话\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I'm, uh... returning your call.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.26,0:43:55.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你记得你企图吓我的那通电话吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You remember the one where you tried to scare me?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.59,0:44:02.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,楼下的人说你在这里的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}The guy downstairs said you were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.89,0:44:05.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哥们  我不在乎你在做什么怪事\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Dude, I don't care what weird shit you're into,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.98,0:44:07.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得谈谈\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}but we gotta talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.96,0:44:13.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  你会付出代价的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}All right, well, you're gonna pay for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.49,0:44:54.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...模拟一个缓慢的欧元区经济体\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}...and help stimulate a slow Eurozone economy...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.45,0:45:03.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord0\fs18\b1}炸药
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.04,0:45:05.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老天爷\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.28,0:45:18.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.84,0:45:32.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们做了安排  如你所要求\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}We made arrangements, as you requested.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.87,0:45:36.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你确定吗\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Are you certain about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.01,0:45:39.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有时间考虑\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}There's still time to think it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.37,0:45:41.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你走吧\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.25,0:46:00.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-世界上最伟大的城市  -是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}- Greatest city in the world. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.95,0:46:02.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,纽约人都喜欢那么说\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}New Yorkers like saying that.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.63,0:46:07.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过  经历了这一切\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Still, after all this time, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.19,0:46:10.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道我对它是什么感觉\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}I don't know how I feel about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.35,0:46:14.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是它的妙处  它可以成为你需要的任何样子\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}That's the beauty of it. It can be whatever you need it to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.04,0:46:18.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你需要它是什么\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}What do you need it to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.89,0:46:20.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,家\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Home.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.80,0:47:22.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...周三中央银行保持利率不变\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}...Central Bank on Wednesday kept interest rates unchanged,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.88,0:47:25.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,顶住了加入其他大中央银行的压力\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}resisting pressure to join other major central banks...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.09,0:47:33.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.29,0:48:27.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是一座城市而已\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}It's just a city.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.17,0:48:32.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会习惯看着它们倒下的\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}You'll get used to watching them fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.04,0:48:59.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得赶紧下去  走楼梯\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}We gotta get down right away. Take the stairs!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.91,0:49:01.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快下楼\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}Get down the stairs!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.13,0:49:20.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你拨打的号码...请查准号码再拨\N{\fn微软雅黑}{\fs14}...you have dialed. Please check the number and dial again.

